from opening.replay
# A trainer uses its items (decomp TrainerAI_ShouldUseItem through the ported AI; Roark carries two
# Potions). A unit-style replay: Piplup at level 40 with Pound only (not very effective on Roark's rock
# types) wears his Pokémon down slowly, so his AI drinks its Potions. The ROM test watches for "Leader Roark
# used one Potion!" and checks that both are spent.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 40 platinum:MOVE_POUND
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_CITY_GYM 5 4 up
until idle
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text
battle auto move 1 20000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_LEADER_ROARK won
advance text 4400
+0 assert state badges ["platinum:BADGE_ID_COAL"]
